2026-07-27T07:53:08.7128371Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:53:08.7196119Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:53:08.7197010Z i /tmp/RtmpTNkbEs/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:53:08.7197330Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:53:08.7197705Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:53:08.7198257Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:53:08.7198767Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:53:08.7199516Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:53:08.7200090Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:53:08.7446573Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:53:08.7562082Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:53:08.8007360Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:53:08.8175683Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
